title: "Household Delegation Benchmark (HDB): AI agents acting for one member of a shared household"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-23
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24459412
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bykovskii
    given-names: George
